# An example to start from: a short walk from Goldshire to the Westfall
# border that hands over to Polestar's Westfall guide. Lines starting with #
# are notes for you; players never see them. Replace it with your own route.
# Every line the format has, with an example each: docs/GUIDE_CHEATSHEET.md
# in Polestar's source.

# The guide's id: your pack id, a slash, then a name of your own.
guide {{id}}/example
# The name players see in the guide menu.
title Goldshire to Westfall
# Only Alliance characters are offered this guide.
faction Alliance
# The levels it is for.
levels 5-10
# The zone its coordinates are in, until a step names another.
zone Elwynn Forest
# The guide that follows when this one ends.
next forever/alliance/02-westfall

# A step: the guide window shows one at a time, until all its goals are done.
step Goldshire
  # A tip is shown under the step's title.
  tip Start at the Lion's Pride Inn in Goldshire, at the crossroads in the middle of Elwynn Forest.
  # Walk to these map coordinates; "r 30" counts anywhere within 30 yards.
  goto 42.9,65.6 "Goldshire" r 30

step The Westbrook Garrison
  tip Follow the road west out of Goldshire. The garrison's watchtower stands where the road crosses the stream.
  goto 24.2,74.5 "Westbrook Garrison" r 30

step Into Westfall
  tip Keep west over the bridge. The road climbs into the dry fields of Westfall, where the next guide picks you up.
  goto 20.6,80.5 "The Westfall border" r 30

# The lines you will use most. Remove the first # to use one inside a step
# (what follows the second # stays a note for you);
# `polestar find <name>` prints the ids.
#
#   accept 47                    # take a quest; giver and title come from the data
#   turnin 47                    # hand it in
#   kill 475 x8                  # kill eight Kobold Tunnelers
#   collect 773 x10 quest 47.1   # loot ten Gold Dust for objective 1 of quest 47
#   talk 240                     # speak to Marshal Dughan
#   getfp "Sentinel Hill"        # learn the flight path there
#   fly "Stormwind"              # take a flight to Stormwind
#   train class only Warrior     # visit the class trainer; only Warriors get this goal
